module: consolidation
name: Kernle.process_status()
summary: >-
  Reports what is waiting for each processing transition, the recent runs, pending suggestions,
  and today's model spend.
notes: >-
  It also shows which triggers are met and why pending suggestions are held.
returns: "Per transition: unprocessed count, trigger state, last run; plus recent runs, pending suggestions by hold reason, and tokens spent today with the budget"
